5,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Let's pick something fun! But we should check how we pay so it's fair for everyone this time.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree. I want to see the total costs upfront. @Sakura, which lists should we check for that?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I'm worried about our balance of time together. I want to know why we felt crowded or lonely last time.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,The travel time is my priority. I don't want to spend the whole trip just getting there and back.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I want to know about the rooms. And the bathrooms. It makes a big difference for me.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Sakura,,I'll look at the all-in rates and what happened with the rooms last time!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I will check the offshore house pricing and the valley inn versus urban beds.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,I'll look into the time alone in the shared-house year and how last year's days ran.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I'll take ferry sailings and train time, plus getting around by train and bus.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I'll check bathing hours and bathroom provision, and the inn mealtimes and room arrangements.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
