30,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"All-in rates are the same for everyone, but separate rooms last time had a huge price difference!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"Offshore houses are cheap at 5,400 yen, but valley inns are 17,000 including meals. City beds are expensive and separate.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Midori,,"Last year we were too separate. But in a shared house, there was absolutely no place to be alone.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The ferry takes two whole days. The train to the spa valley is only ninety minutes.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The island houses only have one bathroom and the water gets cold. The inn has strict mealtimes and shared futons.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, if the island house is cheap, maybe that's the fairest way to split the bill?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"Only if the total is fixed. @Toshio, does the ferry schedule make the island too expensive in terms of time?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, would you prefer the strict schedule of an inn over a house where we are always together?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Toshio,,Two days of travel is too much. The city or the spa town are much more efficient.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,I don't like the shared room at the inn... but one cold bathroom for five people sounds worse.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Sakura,,What about the city? We can just pay for what we eat!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"City beds are 12,000 to 20,000 yen. It's too unpredictable. I prefer the all-in or the house.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Midori,,"The city might lead to us spending the whole day apart again, which I want to avoid.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"The city has the best transport, but the spa town is also fast to reach.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,The city has private rooms with doors. That sounds the most relaxing for me.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,Sakura,,But we want to be together! Maybe the spa town is a good middle ground?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"The spa town is 17,000 yen all-in. That is a very clear number.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,Midori,,A town with a public bath allows us to be together but also step away for a bit.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,Toshio,,Ninety minutes by train is perfect. I vote for the spa town.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"If the inn has a door for my room, I might be okay. But the city is safer.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
