55,3,1,talk,Sakura,,I like the spa town! It sounds like a real group trip and the cost is simple.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Victoria,,The all-in rate at the inn is the most predictable. I'm leaning toward the Hot Spring Town.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Midori,,I agree. It avoids the isolation of the city and the claustrophobia of a single house.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Toshio,,It's the best balance of travel time and group cohesion. I'm sticking with Option C.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I'm still worried about the futons, but the city might be too lonely. I'll try the spa town.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Sakura,,Is everyone okay with the fixed mealtimes at the inn?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"As long as the price doesn't change, I can handle a schedule.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Midori,,It gives us a reason to gather twice a day. It's a good structure.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Toshio,,It's better than waiting for a ferry.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I just hope I can get some sleep.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm voting for the Hot Spring Town!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Victoria,,I vote for the Hot Spring Town as well.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Midori,,I vote for the Hot Spring Town.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Toshio,,Option C for me.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll go with the group. Hot Spring Town.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
